# javdex
===
 Javdex is an out-of-the-box JAV media library desktop client for Windows, macOS, and Linux. Organize local videos, STRM and resource links into a searchable and collectible personal video library, and complete video and actor information through plug-in scraping and AI-assisted collection. It supports multimedia library, cross-library list and NFO import and export, and can also be browsed and played on mobile phones, tablets and TVs through LAN, making the collection in the computer at your fingertips. ..
